# Force LF line endings for text files regardless of a contributor's local
# core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Git for Windows' common default
# (autocrlf=true) rewrites every text file to CRLF on checkout, making the
# entire repo show as "modified" against the LF blobs actually committed —
# pure noise that risks getting committed by accident.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary types: never touch these regardless of the auto-detection
# above.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
